The names "SALPH OS" and "SALPH" and the SALPH logo identify this project.
Modified redistributions must use a different name and logo so users are not
misled about their origin. This does not restrict the rights granted by the
licenses above for the code and artwork themselves.

SALPH OS is based on Debian but is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Debian Project. Third-party components and their licenses: THIRD_PARTY.md.

